<https://decision-cli.dev/oxi-events/ns/mutation/5737c846-049f-407b-b1d5-09b5307bdf72> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://decision-cli.dev/oxi-events/ns#Mutation> <https://decision-cli.dev/oxi-events/ns/meta> .
